  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ntan(x) = 3/4 for 0° (1-sin x)/(1+sin x) = (1 - 3/5) / (1 + 3/5)\n\n⇒ (5/5 - 3/5) / (5/5 + 3/5)\n\n⇒ (2/5) / (8/5)\n\n⇒ (2/5) × (5/8) = 2/8 = 1/4\n\n**∴ The value of (1-sin x)/(1+sin x) is 1/4.**",
